{"case_id": "s08", "kind": "single", "split": "dev", "question": "索引任务最多自动执行多少次，永久错误会自动重试吗？", "answerable": true, "file": "architecture.md", "evidence": "任务默认最多自动执行 3 次；仅瞬时网络错误、429、可重试 5xx 等进入指数退避，永久格式/凭据/维度错误直接失败。", "reference_answer": "任务默认最多自动执行 3 次；仅瞬时网络错误、429、可重试 5xx 等进入指数退避，永久格式/凭据/维度错误直接失败。", "acceptable_facts": ["3|三", "永久", "失败|不"], "corpus_version": "project-docs-v1", "kb_scope": "evaluation-owned-kb", "metadata_filter": {}, "annotation_method": "agent-source-audit-before-new-experiments", "human_annotation_reviewed": false, "file_sha256": "4d31035010252e3601107dd82d9e678cd8ee8cb8be602fdccdca3559281ae3d1", "evidence_unit_count": 1, "annotation_version": "v2-candidate", "reviewer": null, "evidence_units": [{"fact": "最多3次", "alternatives": [{"file": "architecture.md", "file_sha256": "4d31035010252e3601107dd82d9e678cd8ee8cb8be602fdccdca3559281ae3d1", "char_start": 3603, "char_end": 3617, "quote": "任务默认最多自动执行 3 次"}]}, {"fact": "永久错误直接失败", "alternatives": [{"file": "architecture.md", "file_sha256": "4d31035010252e3601107dd82d9e678cd8ee8cb8be602fdccdca3559281ae3d1", "char_start": 3646, "char_end": 3663, "quote": "永久格式/凭据/维度错误直接失败。"}]}]}
{"case_id": "s09", "kind": "single", "split": "dev", "question": "文档删除时先修改数据库还是先删除向量？", "answerable": true, "file": "architecture.md", "evidence": "删除先在 MySQL 逻辑删除并清空有效版本、撤销任务发布资格，再提交清理任务。", "reference_answer": "删除先在 MySQL 逻辑删除并清空有效版本、撤销任务发布资格，再提交清理任务。", "acceptable_facts": ["MySQL", "逻辑删除", "清理"], "corpus_version": "project-docs-v1", "kb_scope": "evaluation-owned-kb", "metadata_filter": {}, "annotation_method": "agent-source-audit-before-new-experiments", "human_annotation_reviewed": false, "file_sha256": "4d31035010252e3601107dd82d9e678cd8ee8cb8be602fdccdca3559281ae3d1", "evidence_unit_count": 1, "annotation_version": "v2-candidate", "reviewer": null, "evidence_units": [{"fact": "删除先在 MySQL 逻辑删除并清空有效版本、撤销任务发布资格，再提交清理任务。", "alternatives": [{"file": "architecture.md", "file_sha256": "4d31035010252e3601107dd82d9e678cd8ee8cb8be602fdccdca3559281ae3d1", "char_start": 4042, "char_end": 4082, "quote": "删除先在 MySQL 逻辑删除并清空有效版本、撤销任务发布资格，再提交清理任务。"}]}]}
