{"case_id": "b04", "kind": "single", "split": "holdout", "question": "成员变更导致知识库失去最后一个有效 owner 时，接口应如何处理？", "answerable": true, "reference_answer": "移除/降级/停用会导致任一未删除知识库失去最后有效 owner 时，整个事务回滚并返回 409 `LAST_OWNER_REQUIRED`。", "acceptable_facts": ["409", "回滚"], "corpus_version": "project-docs-v1", "kb_scope": "evaluation-owned-kb", "metadata_filter": {}, "annotation_version": "v2-candidate", "annotation_method": "agent-authored-before-new-experiments", "human_annotation_reviewed": false, "reviewer": null, "evidence_units": [{"fact": "移除/降级/停用会导致任一未删除知识库失去最后有效 owner 时，整个事务回滚并返回 409 `LAST_OWNER_REQUIRED`。", "alternatives": [{"file": "api.md", "file_sha256": "57f5a2799e4fe5affed7a1c6ec3079f80532553dd70e4ddf0ba4ae61fe0bf866", "char_start": 4262, "char_end": 4332, "quote": "移除/降级/停用会导致任一未删除知识库失去最后有效 owner 时，整个事务回滚并返回 409 `LAST_OWNER_REQUIRED`。"}]}], "file": "api.md", "evidence": "移除/降级/停用会导致任一未删除知识库失去最后有效 owner 时，整个事务回滚并返回 409 `LAST_OWNER_REQUIRED`。", "file_sha256": "57f5a2799e4fe5affed7a1c6ec3079f80532553dd70e4ddf0ba4ae61fe0bf866"}
